From fad331d7cbb5114dd82e25c756095b3788f20e9d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 15:28:28 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 017/638] ipc: admit fixed-width LP64 traits on AROS [chromium]
 [aros]

AI_PHASE: chromium-headless-bringup

AI_STATUS: done

ROOT_CAUSE: The x86-64 AROS ABI defines int64_t as long and uint64_t as unsigned long, but Chromium only enabled the corresponding ParamTraits on other LP64 platforms. Fixed-width IPC values therefore instantiated the deliberately missing generic long specialization.

FIX_REASON: Enable long/unsigned-long ParamTraits only when AROS is built with ARCH_CPU_64_BITS. This represents the fixed-width typedefs without weakening the 32/64-bit wire-compatibility guard for future 32-bit AROS builds.

SCOPE: IPC primitive ParamTraits platform selection.

VALIDATION: toolchain macros report 8-byte long/pointers and int64_t=long; ninja -C out/aros-headless -j4 obj/ipc/ipc/ipc_mojo_param_traits.o

RISK: low; the condition is architecture-gated and uses Chromium's existing 64-bit Pickle encoding.

AI_DECISION_CHAIN: ACD-chromium-native-port-roadmap
---
 ipc/ipc_message_utils.h | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/ipc/ipc_message_utils.h b/ipc/ipc_message_utils.h
index 0c908fd7f9..39b9e33d0d 100644
--- a/ipc/ipc_message_utils.h
+++ b/ipc/ipc_message_utils.h
@@ -210,11 +210,13 @@ struct ParamTraits<unsigned int> {
 //      very few IPCs that cross this boundary.
 //   2) We also need to keep it for Linux for two reasons: int64_t is typedef'd
 //      to long, and gfx::PluginWindow is long and is used in one GPU IPC.
-//   3) Android 64 bit and Fuchsia also have int64_t typedef'd to long.
+//   3) Android 64 bit, AROS 64 bit, and Fuchsia also have int64_t typedef'd to
+//      long.
 // Since we want to support Android 32<>64 bit IPC, as long as we don't have
 // these traits for 32 bit ARM then that'll catch any errors.
 #if BUILDFLAG(IS_WIN) || BUILDFLAG(IS_LINUX) || BUILDFLAG(IS_CHROMEOS) || \
     BUILDFLAG(IS_FUCHSIA) ||                                              \
+    (BUILDFLAG(IS_AROS) && defined(ARCH_CPU_64_BITS)) ||                  \
     (BUILDFLAG(IS_ANDROID) && defined(ARCH_CPU_64_BITS))
 template <>
 struct ParamTraits<long> {
